Chinese speaking Logistics Operations Clerks x 2 (Immediate Starts)
My client are a leading global freight forwarder who are growing rapidly and are seeking two Logistics Operations Service clerk’s to join the Operations team. The role interfaces with both internal and external stakeholders and serves as a key function within the business.
